# Module Overview 

#### Thinking Critically About AI is split into **five milestones**, each containing **two lessons** and centering around a **theme**. This structure helps students break complex ideas into manageable phases while building toward a final product.

<div style="text-align: center; margin: 40px auto;"> <img src="https://images.code.org/84f21d55ad8a972bba224bf43dcca03b-image-1773419936950.jpg" alt="A diagram showing the layout of the unit, with two lessons per milestone. Five milestones and ten lessons total." style="width: 95%; height: auto; border-radius: 10px;"> </div>

## What's included in this module? 

#### This professional learning module mirrors the structure of the Thinking Critically About AI Unit. There are six sections total:

<div style="background-color: #FAFBFC; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px; width: 88%; margin: 20px auto;">

  <p style="font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0;">
    ⭐ Introduction to Thinking Critically About AI (You're here!)
  </p>
  <p style="font-size: 13pt;">
    This section orients you to the learning you will do in this module. It introduces the overarching
    structures of the unit and the key concepts students will learn.
  </p>

  <br>

  <p style="font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold;">
    🌏 Milestone 1: AI in My World (Lessons 1–2)
  </p>
  <p style="font-size: 13pt;">
    You’ll learn how to launch the driving question of the unit and establish norms for questioning AI outputs.
  </p>

  <br>

  <p style="font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold;">
    🔨 Milestone 2: Responsible Creation & Impact (Lessons 3–4)
  </p>
  <p style="font-size: 13pt;">
  You’ll explore how to facilitate ethical discussions and guide students in turning analysis into actionable recommendations.
  </p>

  <br>

  <p style="font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold;">
    💻 Milestone 3: Truth & Credibility (Lessons 5–6)
  </p>
  <p style="font-size: 13pt;">
    You’ll learn how to support fact-checking investigations and critical analysis of AI outputs.
  </p>

  <br>

  <p style="font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold;">
    🦺 Milestone 4: Safety & Privacy (Lessons 7–8)
  </p>
  <p style="font-size: 13pt;">
    You’ll explore how to guide structured risk analysis and synthesis into clearsafety guidance.
  </p>

  <br>

  <p style="font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold;">
    🗣️ Milestone 5: Synthesis & Sharing (Lessons 9–10)
  </p>
  <p style="font-size: 13pt; margin-bottom: 0;">
    You’ll examine strategies for supporting revision, peer critique, and meaningful reflection.
  </p>

</div>

___

#### This professional learning module is designed to prepare you to teach two lessons in Thinking Critically About AI at a time. Feel free to use this module to prepare for a chunk of the curriculum as you see fit - you can always pick up where you left off when you're ready.
MARKDOWN
